{"channelId":"UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","row":["Sheldrick Trust",340000,"Sheldrick Wildlife Trust (SWT) is a global leader in elephant conservation and one of Africa’s most respected wildlife charities. SWT works across Kenya to protect wildlife and preserve habitats through field-based operations and broad community support. At the heart of its work is its pioneering Orphans’ Project — a first-of-its-kind programme to rescue, raise, and rewild orphaned elephants and rhinos.\n\nBacked by 50 years of field experience, SWT delivers practical solutions and long-term impact across Kenya’s most critical landscapes. This channel brings you the latest from the frontlines of conservation: orphan rescues, field operations, and more.","","Kenya"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:49.911Z","channelId":"UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"11b95a04d17b921ccbd7116b1cdb4a987f7b765205b638df17cce28d21e1846b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7186d009724e6aed8a807309a267849fea71dd4c2dd7d76426a5fd41f029c191"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:49.911Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":340000,"raw":"340K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrgRQupv3gyUVN7JjPDco7w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:49.911Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.sheldrickwildlifetrust.org/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T13:31:56.089Z"},{"url":"https://www.sheldrickwildlifetrust.org/get-involved/become-a-partner","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T13:31:56.922Z"},{"url":"https://www.sheldrickwildlifetrust.org/get-involved/other-ways-to-g